第一，培养真正的技能，这需要时间和刻意练习
First, develop real skills. This will take time and deliberate practice.

1205
01:16:35,648 --> 01:16:43,048
第二，你的每一个决策都要有明确目标，最终都是为了盈利
Second, every decision you make should have an end objective which is ultimately to be profitable.

1206
01:16:44,148 --> 01:16:50,648
第三，交易中没有对错，只有高概率和低概率
Number three, there is no wrong or right in trading, only high probability and low probability.

1207
01:16:51,448 --> 01:16:58,448
第四，要有耐心，要有决心，要有纪律，还要有很强的职业道德
Number four, be patient, be determined, be disciplined and have a very strong work ethic.

1208
01:16:58,848 --> 01:17:03,448
这四点是成功的必要条件
These are the four necessities required for success.

1209
01:17:04,348 --> 01:17:08,248
第五，只需要一笔好交易
Number five, it only takes one good trade.

1210
01:17:09,548 --> 01:17:12,148
第六，保持简单
Number six, keep it simple.

1211
01:17:12,648 --> 01:17:15,448
市场说到底是二元的，
The markets are after all only binary.

1212
01:17:15,848 --> 01:17:17,948
要么涨，要么跌
They only go up and down.

1213
01:17:19,148 --> 01:17:23,648
第七，始终把风险管理放在首位
Number seven, always manage risk first and foremost.

1214
01:17:24,748 --> 01:17:27,648
第八，始终保持客观
Number eight, always remain objective.

1215
01:17:29,148 --> 01:17:36,248
第九，对自己诚实，对自己开放，始终准备好学习
Number nine, be honest with yourself, be open with yourself, and always be ready to learn.

1216
01:17:37,548 --> 01:17:40,748
最后第十条，交易的秘诀
Lastly, number 10, the secret to trading.

1217
01:17:42,048 --> 01:17:43,948
理解你所玩的游戏
Understand the game you're playing.

1218
01:17:44,748 --> 01:17:47,748
理解你需要遵循的规则
Understand the rules that you need to follow.

1219
01:17:48,148 --> 01:17:51,148
最重要的是，理解你自己
And most importantly, understand yourself.

1220
01:17:52,448 --> 01:17:59,948
温斯顿·丘吉尔曾说：成功就是从一个失败走向另一个失败，而不丧失热情
Winston Churchill once said, Success is going from failure to failure without a loss of enthusiasm.

1221
01:18:01,148 --> 01:18:05,048
非常感谢，祝你好运，愿你交易生涯顺利
Thank you very much, good luck and I wish you a successful trading career.

